{"id":2161,"name":"孜然牛肉","image":"/images/dishes/htc-2161.jpg","category":"荤菜","taste":"咸鲜","cookingMethod":"炒制","difficulty":"普通","cookingTime":"30分钟","servings":"","ingredients":["牛里脊或牛肩肉","青椒","洋葱","小米椒（可选）","孜然粒","小葱","生抽","料酒","玉米淀粉","食用油","盐"],"preparation":["牛里脊或牛肩肉 300g","青椒 2个（约160g）","洋葱 半个（约100g）","小米椒 2个（可选）","孜然粒 8g","小葱 2根（约10g）","生抽 10ml","料酒 10ml","玉米淀粉 8g","食用油 20ml","盐 2g"],"steps":["牛肉逆着纹理切约 3mm 薄片；青椒和洋葱切丝，小米椒切圈，小葱切段。","牛肉加入生抽、料酒、玉米淀粉和 5ml 食用油抓匀，冷藏腌制 15 分钟。","孜然粒用擀面杖轻轻压碎，保留部分颗粒。","炒锅中大火加热，倒入剩余食用油；放入牛肉迅速摊开，翻炒至刚变色后盛出。","锅中放入洋葱、青椒、小米椒和葱白，大火翻炒 1-2 分钟至断生。","放回牛肉，加入孜然和盐，大火翻炒约 30 秒；确认牛肉熟透后立即关火，撒葱绿即可。"],"advanceTime":"牛肉需冷藏腌制 15 分钟","nutrition":{"calories":"612 大卡"},"videoTutorials":{"platforms":[{"key":"bilibili","name":"哔哩哔哩","searchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=%E5%AD%9C%E7%84%B6%E7%89%9B%E8%82%89%20%E5%AE%B6%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%20%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B"},{"key":"douyin","name":"抖音","searchUrl":"https://www.douyin.com/search/%E5%AD%9C%E7%84%B6%E7%89%9B%E8%82%89%20%E5%AE%B6%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%20%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B?type=video"}]},"source":{"name":"HowToCook","repository":"Anduin2017/HowToCook","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/c694a5c457d45e6e012ae6cd9a7724aab86e320b/dishes/meat_dish/%E5%AD%9C%E7%84%B6%E7%89%9B%E8%82%89.md","imageSource":{"author":"Ewan Munro","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sanxia%20Renjia%2C%20Fitzrovia%2C%20London%20(5561016228).jpg"}}}
